#: ../../troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "排查"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "Find the symptom; the fix is beside it."
msgstr ""
"找到现象，处理方式就在旁边。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:5
msgid "Starting up"
msgstr ""
"启动"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr ""
"现象"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Fix"
msgstr ""
"处理"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`missing config: provider.url, ...`"
msgstr ""
"`missing config: provider.url, ...`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The active provider entry is incomplete. Fill the three keys, or run "
"`minacode --init-config` for a fresh file"
msgstr ""
"当前激活的 provider 条目不完整。补上这三个键，或运行 `minacode --init-config` 生成一份新文件"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Authentication errors"
msgstr ""
"鉴权错误"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`url`, `key`, and `model` must come from the same provider"
msgstr ""
"`url`、`key`、`model` 必须来自同一个服务商"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`compaction provider ... is missing`"
msgstr ""
"`compaction provider ... is missing`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The `[compaction]` entry needs its own url, key, and model. See "
"[Compaction model](configuration.md#compaction-model)"
msgstr ""
"`[compaction]` 条目需要自己的 url、key 和 model。见[压缩模型](configuration.md#compaction-model)"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Model calls"
msgstr ""
"模型调用"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Failed at once, no retry"
msgstr ""
"没有重试就直接失败"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Quota and billing errors never retry — a second try fails the same way. "
"The error text comes from your provider"
msgstr ""
"额度与账单错误从不重试——再试一次结果一样。错误正文来自你的 provider"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`Model response exceeded provider.response_timeout`"
msgstr ""
"`Model response exceeded provider.response_timeout`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Raise `response_timeout` on that entry, or set `0` to wait indefinitely"
msgstr ""
"调大该条目的 `response_timeout`，或设为 `0` 表示无限等待"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Model or parameter rejected"
msgstr ""
"模型或参数被拒绝"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Set `api` explicitly instead of leaving it to detection, and check the "
"model name against the provider's list. `/config` shows what is in use"
msgstr ""
"显式设置 `api`，不要交给自动识别，并对照 provider 的列表核对模型名。`/config` 显示当前生效的值"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:21
msgid ""
"Rate limits, timeouts, and server errors do retry, counting up on the "
"divider as `retrying 2/6`."
msgstr ""
"限流、超时和服务端错误会重试，并在分隔线上以 `retrying 2/6` 计数。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:23
msgid "Context and summaries"
msgstr ""
"上下文与摘要"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Context trimmed, no summary"
msgstr ""
"上下文被裁剪，但没有摘要"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The summary request failed; room was made anyway. See [When a summary "
"does not arrive](context.md#when-a-summary-does-not-arrive)"
msgstr ""
"摘要请求失败了，但空间仍然腾了出来。见[摘要没有拿到时](context.md#when-a-summary-does-not-arrive)"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`nothing is left to compact`"
msgstr ""
"`nothing is left to compact`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The latest exchange alone fills the window, usually one huge tool result."
" Start a fresh session, or raise `runtime.max_context_tokens`"
msgstr ""
"仅最近一次交互就填满了窗口，通常是某个特别大的工具结果。开一个新会话，或调大 `runtime.max_context_tokens`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`/compact` says nothing to compact"
msgstr ""
"`/compact` 说没有可压缩的内容"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Everything left is too recent to drop. Nothing is wrong"
msgstr ""
"剩下的都太新，不允许丢弃。这不是故障"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Cache ratio near zero"
msgstr ""
"缓存命中率接近零"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Something changed early in the request — a model switch, a new server, a "
"new skill. It recovers over the next turns. See [Prompt "
"caching](context.md#prompt-caching)"
msgstr ""
"请求靠前的部分变了——切换模型、新连的服务器、新装的 skill。接下来的几个回合会恢复。见[提示词缓存](context.md#prompt-caching)"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Tokens climbing fast"
msgstr ""
"token 涨得很快"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"`/status` splits conversation from summary usage; [Spending "
"less](context.md#spending-less) lists the levers"
msgstr ""
"`/status` 会把对话用量与摘要用量分开；[更省钱](context.md#spending-less)列出了各个杠杆"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:33
msgid "Tools and edits"
msgstr ""
"工具与编辑"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`stale anchor ...`"
msgstr ""
"`stale anchor ...`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The file changed after it was read, so the edit was refused rather than "
"misapplied. Ask for a re-read"
msgstr ""
"文件在被读取之后发生了变化，因此这次编辑被拒绝而不是错误落盘。让它重新读一次"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Confirmation every time"
msgstr ""
"每次都要确认"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The default for writing files and running commands. `/yolo` turns it off;"
" read [Safety](safety.md) first"
msgstr ""
"写文件和执行命令的默认行为。`/yolo` 可以关闭；先读[安全](safety.md)"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Code index `stale` or `?`"
msgstr ""
"代码索引显示 `stale` 或 `?`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Run `/index`. Search still works without it, just slower and less precise"
msgstr ""
"运行 `/index`。没有它搜索依然可用，只是更慢、更不精确"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:41
msgid "Sessions"
msgstr ""
"会话"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`Session snapshot not found`"
msgstr ""
"`Session snapshot not found`"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Gone or from another project. `/sessions all` lists everything saved"
msgstr ""
"已经不在，或者属于另一个项目。`/sessions all` 会列出所有保存的会话"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "A session disappeared"
msgstr ""
"某个会话不见了"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"Sessions idle for seven days are swept at startup. "
"`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` keeps them"
msgstr ""
"七天没有动过的会话会在启动时清理。`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` 则保留"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Blanks where details belong"
msgstr ""
"本该有细节的地方是空的"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The session predates the feature. See [Sessions started before these "
"features](context.md#sessions-started-before-these-features)"
msgstr ""
"这个会话早于该功能。见[在这些功能之前开始的会话](context.md#sessions-started-before-these-features)"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "`/sessions` refuses to switch"
msgstr ""
"`/sessions` 不肯切换"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "A request is in flight. Press `Ctrl-C`, then run it again"
msgstr ""
"有请求正在进行中。先按 `Ctrl-C`，再运行一次"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:50
msgid "Delegation"
msgstr ""
"委派"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid "Nothing ever delegates"
msgstr ""
"从来没有发生过委派"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
msgid ""
"The model decides, and there is no way to force one. See [When nothing "
"delegates](worker.md#when-nothing-delegates)"
msgstr ""
"由模型决定，无法强制发起。见[当什么都没有被委派时](worker.md#when-nothing-delegates)"

#~ msgid "What each symptom means, and what to do about it."
#~ msgstr "每个现象意味着什么，以及该怎么处理。"

#~ msgid "It will not start"
#~ msgstr "启动不起来"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`missing config: provider.url, provider.key, "
#~ "provider.model`** — the active provider "
#~ "entry is incomplete. Open "
#~ "`~/.minacode/config.toml` and fill in the "
#~ "three required keys, or run `minacode"
#~ " --init-config` to write a fresh "
#~ "starter file. `/config` shows which "
#~ "entry is active."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`missing config: provider.url, provider.key, "
#~ "provider.model`** —— 当前激活的 provider 条目不完整。打开"
#~ " `~/.minacode/config.toml` 补上这三个必填键，或运行 `minacode "
#~ "--init-config` 写一份新的起始配置。`/config` 会显示当前激活的是哪个条目。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Requests fail with an authentication "
#~ "error** — the key is wrong for "
#~ "the url, or the entry belongs to"
#~ " a different vendor than the model"
#~ " name suggests. Check that `url`, "
#~ "`key`, and `model` in the active "
#~ "entry come from the same provider."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**请求返回鉴权错误** —— key 与 url "
#~ "不匹配，或者这个条目其实属于另一家厂商，而不是模型名看起来的那家。确认激活条目里的 `url`、`key`、`model`"
#~ " 来自同一个服务商。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**It failed instantly instead of "
#~ "retrying.** Rate limits, timeouts, and "
#~ "server errors are retried automatically, "
#~ "with the attempt shown as `retrying "
#~ "2/6` on the divider. Two kinds of"
#~ " failure never retry, because a "
#~ "second attempt would fail the same "
#~ "way: <span class=\"marker\">quota and billing"
#~ " errors</span> — an exhausted balance, "
#~ "an expired plan — and a response"
#~ " that hit the model's output cap. "
#~ "Read the error text: it comes from"
#~ " your provider and names the account"
#~ " problem."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**它没有重试，直接就失败了。** 限流、超时和服务端错误会自动重试，重试次数会以 `retrying "
#~ "2/6` 显示在分隔线上。有两类失败从不重试，因为再试一次结果一样：<span "
#~ "class=\"marker\">额度与账单错误</span>——余额耗尽、套餐过期——以及触到模型输出上限的响应。看错误正文：它来自你的"
#~ " provider，会指出账号上的问题。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`Model response exceeded "
#~ "provider.response_timeout=600s`** — one response "
#~ "took longer than the total-generation"
#~ " limit. Raise `response_timeout` for that"
#~ " provider entry, or set it to "
#~ "`0` to wait indefinitely. See [Optional"
#~ " provider settings](configuration.md#optional-"
#~ "provider-settings)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`Model response exceeded "
#~ "provider.response_timeout=600s`** —— 一次响应超过了总生成时限。调大该 "
#~ "provider 条目的 `response_timeout`，或设为 `0` "
#~ "表示无限等待。见[可选的 provider 设置](configuration.md#optional-"
#~ "provider-settings)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`context is over budget and nothing"
#~ " is left to compact`** — the "
#~ "latest exchange alone exceeds the "
#~ "window, so there is nothing older "
#~ "to summarize. It is usually one "
#~ "enormous tool result. Start a fresh "
#~ "session for the next task, or "
#~ "raise `runtime.max_context_tokens` if the "
#~ "model's window allows."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`context is over budget and nothing"
#~ " is left to compact`** —— "
#~ "仅最近这一次交互就已经超出窗口，没有更早的内容可以摘要了。通常是某个特别大的工具结果。为下一个任务开一个新会话，或者在模型窗口允许时调大"
#~ " `runtime.max_context_tokens`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`/compact` says there is nothing to"
#~ " compact.** Everything left is recent "
#~ "enough that compaction may not drop "
#~ "it. Nothing is wrong — the context"
#~ " is already as small as it "
#~ "gets."
#~ msgstr "**`/compact` 说没有可压缩的内容。** 剩下的都足够新，压缩不允许丢弃它们。这不是故障——上下文已经小到不能再小了。"

#~ msgid "Cache and cost"
#~ msgstr "缓存与花费"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**The cache ratio sits near zero.** "
#~ "A provider reuses a request only "
#~ "up to its first difference, so "
#~ "anything that changes the beginning of"
#~ " a request — switching models, "
#~ "connecting an MCP server, installing a"
#~ " skill — starts a fresh prefix. "
#~ "It recovers over the following turns "
#~ "if you leave those alone. Not "
#~ "every provider caches, and each reports"
#~ " it differently; see [Prompt "
#~ "caching](context.md#prompt-caching)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**缓存命中率一直接近零。** provider "
#~ "只会复用请求中第一处差异之前的部分，所以任何改变请求开头的动作——切换模型、连接 MCP 服务器、安装 "
#~ "skill——都会让前缀重新开始。只要不再动它们，接下来的几个回合就会恢复。并非所有 provider "
#~ "都做缓存，各家的统计口径也不同；见[提示词缓存](context.md#prompt-caching)。"

#~ msgid "Editing and tools"
#~ msgstr "编辑与工具"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`stale anchor ...`** — the file "
#~ "changed after the agent read it, "
#~ "so the edit was refused rather "
#~ "than applied to the wrong lines. "
#~ "This is the guardrail working. Ask "
#~ "the agent to re-read the file "
#~ "and try again."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`stale anchor ...`** —— 文件在 agent "
#~ "读过之后发生了变化，因此这次编辑被拒绝，而不是落到错误的行上。这是防护在起作用。让 agent 重新读一次文件再试。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**The code index says `stale` or "
#~ "`?`.** Run `/index` to rebuild it. "
#~ "Search and navigation still work without"
#~ " it — they fall back to "
#~ "scanning — but symbol lookups are "
#~ "slower and less precise."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**代码索引显示 `stale` 或 `?`。** 运行 `/index`"
#~ " 重建。没有索引搜索和导航依然可用——它们会退回到扫描——只是符号查找更慢、更不精确。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`Session snapshot not found`** — the"
#~ " id does not exist under this "
#~ "data directory, or it was swept. "
#~ "Run `/sessions all` to list everything"
#~ " saved, across projects."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`Session snapshot not found`** —— 这个"
#~ " id 在当前数据目录下不存在，或者已经被清理。运行 `/sessions all` "
#~ "可以列出所有项目里保存的全部会话。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**A session I expected is gone.** "
#~ "Sessions untouched for seven days are"
#~ " removed at startup. Resuming one "
#~ "resets its clock; `runtime.session_retention_days"
#~ " = 0` keeps them indefinitely. See"
#~ " [Sessions](usage.md#sessions)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**我以为还在的会话不见了。** "
#~ "七天没有动过的会话会在启动时被清理。恢复一个会话会重置它的计时；`runtime.session_retention_days "
#~ "= 0` 则永久保留。见[会话](usage.md#sessions)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`/sessions` refuses to switch.** Switching"
#~ " mid-turn would abandon a request "
#~ "already in flight. Press `Ctrl-C` first,"
#~ " then run it again."
#~ msgstr "**`/sessions` 不肯切换。** 在回合进行中切换会丢弃一个已经发出的请求。先按 `Ctrl-C`，再运行一次。"

